<description>&lt;p&gt;Former president Joseph Kabila has launched a new political-military front that incorporates the M23 rebels in eastern DR Congo. Erik Prince's security personnel were ambushed, resulting in the death of a former New Zealand special forces officer and wounds to former UFC fighter Tim Kennedy. The fighting intensifies around the M23 campaign as Kabila’s front joins the rebels. The UCDP recorded 1,158 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxOc19GYU1FOTRFdS15QkpsUmlibEZXQkhrSkZUbDdjWXpxdWdmdENsa1gtY2ZOMW1ISTA0T2VKc0RmMnNFX0djZzNJZ3FBWGxKa1BRNjNyRDFqOERFZV9UQmtueks2WXc0NDhzN0FQVXZEUDV1YnV3X0Q3M1RqNFd2SlJYYkhDSTI5SG1zajZtNHpOdHVQSWYxRFJuNTZOaFhf?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxPLTByaHp2aXdsckJqcUp3Z1ViazJ5YU5wN1BXS1hTNVpVNTZlRHdibDJNb092TEVhODdYWXdSaVMzemFrbHFGc1NqLUNSc1RxczBSMThiMl9vSFA3WVVHOU8yMlhoMVZPNjluTUUwd25hTFNvaUtLMmVkSUZoQ3VSbVlTZ0pTNHBNXzVIclQybUhqMGttNXBxSTgwdV81UlhlNGNqOWQxUlQ5czl6?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxPemlZQ19WZTBtX0JEU29mb3pyRk9LdkxHMlZ4amNGYy13UUZhTUozLXhUWG5zQzRzWkk3Y3FnZkRGZ2F6NDlsTzlFaVB0ZFZCVi1FMFBjcGRRcGs0T0VUQXo5NGNkNHVCTlRiT2JXTzc5ZkFsMzRwT3FrUDJCYzZ5NjBtR1ZxM19fRjFLaHc5V2pTT29qUUtzaGpVZmZhS1Bsb1Y2aE5NaUdseVZLRnZuUUlPSnFLYkpaWUVHNA?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxQWG82Q0d6UG84ZFAwZ3dMVXFMNklDbkVWU2ZhRXN3VFpFbkhpaHBfSUJDZ004ZFRTZVFNUjc3cllNVEFSa2RTa3RIdDNFTWhaQ0h5Y3U0UndhUDd3dW1NaVh6YjQ4U0UySm1scE9zV3VVRURyTE94X0xOT2lOOExOcEt3bzFwbnZNSF9NR3NfSXhhN0FiX2Fac05WeEc1MG1seHdRYVRUNGRQY3RrTEJKVw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxPSnRfZ